<div class="card">
  <h1>Dummy Phoenix app</h1>
  <p>
    This app exists so you can see PgHero mounted the same way a real host
    application would: <code>config :pghero, repo: Dummy.Repo</code> and
    <code>pghero "/pghero"</code> in the router.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="/pghero">Open PgHero</a>
  </p>
